{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":492227,"name":"Müşvik ASADZADE","username":"Musvik_ASADZADE","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/e95f7d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-16T02:04:25.967Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI cannot complete the initial Grok Bot setup.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery time I try to set up Grok Bot, the provisioning process fails with the following error:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRetry exhausted for onboarding-bot-provision after 3 attempts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have retried the setup multiple times and restarted the application, but the same error continues.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt appears that the Agent Computer / hosted machine provisioning for my account may be stuck or failing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould someone from the Cursor team please check the backend provisioning status for my account and reset/reprovision the Agent Computer if necessary?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have also contacted Cursor support by email.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot.\u003cbr\u003e\nStart the initial onboarding/setup.\u003cbr\u003e\nWait for the Agent Computer to be provisioned.\u003cbr\u003e\nSetup fails after 3 attempts.\u003cbr\u003e\nError appears: Retry exhausted for onboarding-bot-provision after 3 attempts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot should complete onboarding and successfully provision the Agent Computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/e/8/e82ff83b199fa6c83a9c6566dc6cccb635ce9174.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/x81xXa81EMfV1LLzPNdih6LbggY.png?dl=1\" title=\"Ekran Resmi 2026-09-16 05.03.26.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/8/e82ff83b199fa6c83a9c6566dc6cccb635ce9174_2_690x448.png\" alt=\"Ekran Resmi 2026-09-16 05.03.26.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"x81xXa81EMfV1LLzPNdih6LbggY\" width=\"690\" height=\"448\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/8/e82ff83b199fa6c83a9c6566dc6cccb635ce9174_2_690x448.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/8/e82ff83b199fa6c83a9c6566dc6cccb635ce9174_2_1035x672.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/8/e82ff83b199fa6c83a9c6566dc6cccb635ce9174_2_1380x896.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"090808\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eEkran Resmi 2026-09-16 05.03.26.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2940×1912 174 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\nMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 0.51.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease channel: Stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOperating system: macOS (Darwin)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492227-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492227-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-16T02:04:35.744Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":9,"readers_count":8,"score":11.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171807,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-onboarding-provisioning-fails-after-3-attempts","display_username":"Müşvik ASADZADE","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138018,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-onboarding-provisioning-fails-after-3-attempts/171807/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":492306,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-16T05:44:56.137Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. You were right, it’s not your Mac or PC and it’s not your settings. The cloud computer linked to your account is stuck in a state that retrying and reinstalling the app can’t fix, so every attempt to create your first Bot fails the same way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m recreating the cloud computer on my side. After that, fully quit Grok Bot (Grok Bot menu \u0026gt; Quit on Mac, or right-click the tray icon \u0026gt; Quit on Windows), reopen it, and run setup again. It should go through.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you want to unblock yourself right now, there’s a working workaround. Log in to Grok Bot on your phone. The mobile app creates the first Bot directly, and after that the desktop app opens normally. Then on desktop go to Settings \u0026gt; Updates \u0026gt; Update Grok Bot’s Computer to bring the cloud computer up to date.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes and I’ll keep an eye on your case.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-16T05:44:56.137Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":11.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171807,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-onboarding-provisioning-fails-after-3-attempts","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"vers